    "reviews": "\u201c...a nostalgic venture into classic JRPG tactics combined with beautiful art and well-written characters, all driven by a compelling and engaging narrative-driven story.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 TheGamer<br><br>\u201c...just oozes quality. ...the art is absolutely stunning, and the music is like JRPG comfort food.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 Gamezebo<br><br>\u201c...the story really does seem to be the focus.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br>",
